# inatlookup

Fast Reverse Lookup for iNaturalist Photos. Recover an iNaturalist observation from a photo URL.

## Features

- Works from photo ID or photo URL
- Binary search over 475 million photo records
- Uses the public iNaturalist Open Data
- Fast lookups
- Compact 11.4 GB index

## Example

Input

https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/455606536/original.jpeg

Output

Observation ID: 254368720

https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/254368720
